tate":"known","summary":"2026-08-12のIssues説明は、勤務間の最低時間をScheduling Rules違反の対象に含め、その種類に必要な機能はExpertからと明記する。一般Issuesは全プランで、種類ごとの表示は設定でON/OFFにできる。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"C05","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B34-20261013-OBS0002","label":"勤務間の休息時間","limitations":"APIのenforcesという総括を全手動操作のhard拒否へ拡張しない。既存helpは草案保存/公開時に管理者へ警告と説明し、応募阻止も選択式。無条件hard制約・Expert全契約のAPI権・実API応答は未確認。設定もAPI呼出しも行っていない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B34-20261013","scope":"Operations scheduling policies; documented preventClaim switch; schedulerApi plan limitation; customer entitlement unconfirmed; documented partial scope; no independent product validation or customer runtime confirmation"},"sources":[{"locator":"Rule fields / Authentication / minHoursBetweenShifts example","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Connecteam — Scheduling Rule Policies","url":"https://developer.connecteam.com/docs/company-policies-scheduling-rules"}],"state":"known","summary":"休息ルールにもpreventClaimがあり、trueは違反するOpen Shift応募を阻止し、falseは管理者へ報告して応募を阻止しない。ガイドの既定はtrue、休息11.0時間の例はfalse。APIにはschedulerApi利用条件がある。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"C05","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B34-20261013-OBS0001","label":"勤務間の休息時間","limitations":"終業→次始業の差の実計算、等号・端数丸め、夜勤跨日/月境界/DST、複数勤務表の対象勤務対は未試験。11.0はAPI例で既定/法定値ではない。helpの複数方針追加案内とAPIの会社方針1件/再割当置換は表面仕様が異なり、実整合未確認。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B34-20261013","scope":"Operations scheduling policies; API guide with v1 endpoints; schedulerApi entitlement required; documented partial scope; no independent product validation or customer runtime confirmation"},"sources":[{"locator":"Overview / Rule Types / Get user scheduling rule policies","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Connecteam — Scheduling Rule Policies","url":"https://developer.connecteam.com/docs/company-policies-scheduling-rules"}],"state":"known","summary":"APIガイドはminHoursBetweenShiftsを時間単位の数値と定義する。会社方針と個人customの同じ休息ルールが重なる場合は大きい値を採用し、個人GETは有効な会社/個人ルールを返す。無効な方針は適用されない。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"C05","label":"勤務間の休息時間","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"D01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B37-20261013-OBS0002","label":"資格・職種別の必要人数","limitations":"1つのJobに対する募集枠と適格者範囲の部分確認。枠数は臨床配置基準・資格別最低人数や同一勤務の資格構成比ではない。資格失効/兼務二重計上・未充足違反の独立検算、実応募/Expert個別契約/上限/顧客版は未確認。既存一般Open Shift承認やC05応募制限は反復しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B37-20261013","scope":"Operations Basic+ open shifts; Advanced+ approval; qualifying Job required; help 2025-03-18; documented limited or contextual scope; no independent product/credential test or customer contract/runtime confirmation"},"sources":[{"locator":"Create Open Shift / available spots / qualified users / Basic-Advanced footer","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Connecteam — How to Create Open Shifts","url":"https://help.connecteam.com/en/articles/6441778-how-to-create-open-shifts"}],"state":"known","summary":"Open Shiftは勤務のJobを指定してavailable spotsを設定し、未充足枠数を表示する。公開・応募はそのJobの適格者が対象で、通常は先着応募で本人の勤務表へ追加される。Open ShiftはOperations Basic以上、承認付きはAdvancedからと説明する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"D01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B37-20261013-OBS0001","label":"資格・職種別の必要人数","limitations":"適格者の管理指定で、医療資格マスターとの照合・期限/失効の自動更新・資格AND/OR・職種組合せの必要人数/違反検出ではない。Smart Groupの所属変更反映時点、親設定変更/既存勤務への影響、顧客版/Expert権利・実拒否は未確認。既存自動割当の一般適格性を再登録しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B37-20261013","scope":"Job/Sub-job qualified users or smart groups; help 2026-08-03; exact customer plan/version unconfirmed; documented limited or contextual scope; no independent product/credential test or customer contract/runtime confirmation"},"sources":[{"locator":"Qualify via 