"https://connecteam.com/privacy/"}],"state":"known","summary":"Privacy Noticeは顧客のUser Content等をprocessor/DPAの範囲に分け、processorデータは顧客指示の期間保持すると説明する。サポート等の通信記録による自社AI代表の改善は別のcontroller用途として記載する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"N05","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B38-20261013-OBS0005","label":"生成AIへの送信・学習利用","limitations":"KB FAQのAzure OpenAI/Gemini/OpenAI列挙にはAnthropicがなく、資料の対象/版/機能差は未解消。Google会社一覧を全機能のGemini実行と断定せず、顧客ごとのprovider選択/region固定/越境・データ項目/学習・保持条件や第三者保証は未確認。一覧だけで全AI経路/契約を確定しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B38-20261013","scope":"Public subprocessor list; listed locations only; mismatch with KB FAQ preserved; public vendor statement only; no independent data-flow/permission test or executed customer contract confirmation"},"sources":[{"locator":"AI entries Microsoft / Google / OpenAI / Anthropic","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Connecteam — Subprocessors","url":"https://connecteam.com/subprocessors/"}],"state":"known","summary":"公式委託先一覧はAzure OpenAIのSweden Central、生成AI用途のGoogle（米国）、AI機能用途のOpenAI（米国）に加え、AI Agent用途のAnthropic（米国）を載せる。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"N05","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B38-20261013-OBS0004","label":"生成AIへの送信・学習利用","limitations":"設定名/入口/各Hub・機能への反映範囲・権限差/送信停止実測は未確認。AI特約のAgentic機能の既定有効/Administrator権限内実行と、KB個別Deactivateを同一UI/同一機能としない。顧客のOperations Expert提供権利や利用停止によるデータ削除を推測しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B38-20261013","scope":"Public Terms 2026-09-15; Account Owner opt out claim; feature-specific behavior untested; public vendor statement only; no independent data-flow/permission test or executed customer contract confirmation"},"sources":[{"locator":"Section 1.7: AI Features defaults / Account Owner settings / AI Terms link","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Connecteam — Terms of Service","url":"https://connecteam.com/terms-conditions/"}],"state":"known","summary":"利用規約1.7はAI機能がopt-inまたは既定有効になり、既定有効の場合Account Ownerがユーザー設定からopt outできると記載し、AI特約も適用すると説明する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"N05","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B38-20261013-OBS0003","label":"生成AIへの送信・学習利用","limitations":"公開2026-09-15版の文言で、独立した学習停止保証・全AIのzero retention・改善用途の保存期間を確定しない。FAQのLLM基盤保持とConnecteam内保持は別。対象顧客の締結版/付属契約、匿名化、具体送信項目/委託先別実装/第三者保証は未確認。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B38-20261013","scope":"Public Special AI Terms 2026-09-15; training wording and permitted service use distinguished; public vendor statement only; no independent data-flow/permission test or executed customer contract confirmation"},"sources":[{"locator":"Content Rights: training and service-use paragraph","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Connecteam — Special Terms for Generative AI Features","url":"https://connecteam.com/ai-terms/"}],"state":"known","summary":"AI特約のContent Rightsは、ConnecteamによるUser ContentでのAI Features横断学習/改善を禁じ、AI委託先のモデル学習/改善を積極的に許可しない一方、User Content/Outputをサービス提供・改善・保守等へ用い得ると記載する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"N05","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B38-20261013-OBS0002","label":"生成AIへの送信・学習利用","limitations":"個別KB Agentの状態操作であり、全AI/全外部送信の一括停止、既存データ削除/保持終了、Account Ownerの権限試験やスケジュールAI停止ではない。管理画面/送信停止の実観測/顧客版/復帰時挙動は未確認。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B38-20261013","scope":"Individual Communications KB Agent lifecycle; global opt-out untested; public vendor statement only; no independent data-flow/permission test or executed customer contract confirmation"},"sources":[{"locator":"Deactivating your AI Agent steps 1-5","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Connecteam — Connecteam''s Knowledge Base Agent: Your Company''s AI Assistant","url":"https://help.connecteam.com/en/articles/11112114-connecteam-s-knowledge-base-agent-your-company-s-ai-assistant"}],"state":"known