みに固定割当とソフト希望の二方式を案内。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"B05","label":"セルフスケジューリング","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"B06","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B29-20261013-OBS0007","label":"複数部署・施設の一括計画","limitations":"職員グループの共同勤務条件で、組織階層や部署ごとのデータ閲覧権限ではない。groupShiftsPerDayLimitはpreviewで変更対象、商用プラン/現行実行版の適用は未確認。上限1は同じ開始終了の条件で、施設人数上限/需要配置数にしない。latestとの版差・独立実行なし。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B29-20261013","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; commercial plan applicability and live execution unconfirmed; vendor examples are not independent tests"},"sources":[{"locator":"Requiring a shared tag type / Limiting group shift hours per day (preview)","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Pairing employees","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/pairing-employees"}],"state":"known","summary":"commonTagTypeは同時勤務の職員に同じ部署/場所等のタグを要求でき、groupByEmployeeTagで職員グループへ適用する。previewのgroupShiftsPerDayLimitはそのグループの同一日・共通タグの勤務時刻の種類数を上限で制限する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"B06","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B29-20261013-OBS0006","label":"複数部署・施設の一括計画","limitations":"同じ職員の複数施設勤務の制約。道路/交通手段/渋滞から算出する実移動時間ではなく、設定値60分や週2拠点は例で既定/法定値ではない。座標一致・同一施設内の別部署・日跨ぎ/境界・休息との重複適用は未試験。必須時は未割当があり得る。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B29-20261013","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; commercial plan applicability and live execution unconfirmed; vendor examples are not independent tests"},"sources":[{"locator":"Minimum time between shifts including travel / Maximum number of locations / Haversine distance","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Shift travel and locations","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/shift-travel-and-locations"}],"state":"known","summary":"勤務地を座標で入力し、異なる勤務地の勤務間に設定した最小分数をhardで守る。locationsWorkedMaxは期間内の勤務地数をREQUIREDならhard、PREFERREDならsoftで制限する。距離はHaversineによる直線距離と説明する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"B06","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B29-20261013-OBS0005","label":"複数部署・施設の一括計画","limitations":"単一モデル内のルール対象フィルタ。タグによる勤務割当資格や閲覧/編集拒否とは別で、部署タグを付けるだけでは職員の部署外割当を禁止しない。タグ型を用いるcommonTagTypeには宣言が必要。テナント認可・行単位ACLの独立検証なし。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B29-20261013","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; commercial plan applicability and live execution unconfirmed; vendor examples are not independent tests"},"sources":[{"locator":"Tags and tag types / declare existing tag for tag-type rules / basic filters","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Tags and tag types","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/user-guide/tags-and-tag-types"}],"state":"known","summary":"部署などのタグはtagTypesで分類でき、同じタグIDを職員・勤務・ルールで再利用する。ルールのinclude/excludeEmployeeTagsとinclude/excludeShiftTagsは対象職員や勤務を絞る。単純フィルタにはトップレベルの全タグ列挙を必須としない。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"B06","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B29-20261013-OBS0004","label":"複数部署・施設の一括計画","limitations":"1.35.xモデルの用途案内。独立テナント間の共同最適化、既存部署表の自動統合、部署管理者の認可・変更承認、職員/施設の上限や商用プラン適用は未確認。全施設の需要充足/最適性/運用UIの完成を保証しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B29-20261013","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; commercial plan applicability and live execution unconfirmed; vendor examples are not independent tests"},"sources":[{"locator":"Hospital ward/department mapping / Hospitality shared workforce / requirement patterns","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Use case guide","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/user-guide/use-cases"}],"state":"known","summary":"病棟・部署はタグで表し、複数アウトレットを共有職員から配置する利用例を公式に案内する。部署固有の割当資格は技能で表す。勤務ごとの表閲覧だけではなく、同一モデル内へ部署別勤務と職員を入力する用途の記載を確認した。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"B06","label":"複数部署・施設の一括計画","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":0,"findings":[{"criterion":"B07","delivery":"unknown","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B01-O00344","label":"プラン・追加機能の境界","limitations":"公式記載の範囲のみ。設問の全要件・実動作・対象プランの詳細は未検証。","scope":{"product_scope":"プラン・地域・モジュールの限定は本文及びlimitations参照","record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B01-20261011","scope":"公式記載の範囲のみ"},"sources":[{"locator":"Plan comparison","retrieved_on":"2026-10-11","title":"Timefold API/Solverプラン","url":"https://timefold.ai/pricing"}],"state":"known","summary":"Spark・Flow・Horizonの機能と運用形態を分ける。独自ルール・What-if等は契約範囲に依存。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"B07","label":"プラン・追加機能の境界","rationale":"公式記述の範囲で採用。設問の全要件と実性能への合格判定ではない。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"C01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B33-20261013-OBS0003","label":"二交代・三交代・混在勤務","limitations":"勤務列の表現・例を部分確認しただけで、混在交代制度・臨床配置基準・法令適合・月境界/夜勤日帰属の保証ではない。PROHIBITEDの説明はmulti dayとsingle dayの制約名を併記しており、名称の誤記/実制約対応は未確定。soft条件は満たされなくても割当され得る。実出力、顧客現行版/プランは未確認。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B33-20261013","scope":"ESS fixed documentation 1.35.x; documented partial scope, not independent product validation; commercial plan and current runtime unconfirmed"},"sources":[{"locator":"Define multi-day shift sequences / Preferred / Unpreferred / Prohibited multi-day shift sequence","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Multi-day shift sequence patterns","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/shift-rotations-and-patterns/multi-day-shift-sequence-patterns"}],"state":"known","summary":"multiDayShiftSequencePatternRulesを契約に設定し、職員へ契約を紐付け、勤務タグに一致するONとOFFの順序を定義する。PREFERREDは部分的なpattern要素にsoft報酬、UNPREFERREDは完全一致した列にsoft罰則、PROHIBITEDは翌日のLate→Early等の列をhard条件で禁じる例を示す。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"C01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B33-20261013-OBS0002","label":"二交代・三交代・混在勤務","limitations":"最大日数は割当勤務の件数や連続勤務日数と同じではない。期間内の空き日とgroup間の休日の扱いを混同しない。夜勤跨日・ローテーション開始/終了境界・前月からの継承・複数体系混在/三交代固定順序は未検証。PREFERREDのmin/maxをREQUIREDの最低日数保証にしない。週次とCUSTOMを1観測に混ぜず、同一文書数を水増ししない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B33-20261013","scope":"ESS fixed documentation 1.35.x; documented partial scope, not independent product validation; commercial plan and current runtime unconfirmed"},"sources":[{"locator":"Required custom shift rotations / Length of the maximum rotation period","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Shift rotations","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/shift-rotations-and-patterns/shift-rotations"}],"state":"known","summary":"CUSTOM REQUIREDのrequiredRotationPeriodMaxSizeInDaysは同じrotationGroupの期間の最大日数を定める。公式例は1月1/2/3/5日の朝勤務を5日間、1月8/10/11/13日の午後勤務を6日間と数え、異なるgroup期間の間の1月6/7日の休日を含めない。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"C01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B33-20261013-OBS0001","label":"二交代・三交代・混在勤務","limitations":"モデル化された勤務種別の交代を部分確認したが、病棟内の二交代/三交代混在プリセット、日本の夜勤体系/境界日/祝日跨ぎ・時差/DST・複数契約競合の実試験は未確認。rotationGroupのANYやinclude/exclude排他はこのルールの条件で、既存B29のタグ一般を反復しない。固定文書版は顧客実行版/プランの認定ではない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B33-20261013","scope":"ESS fixed documentation 1.35.x; documented partial scope, not independent product validation; commercial plan and current runtime unconfirmed"},"sources":[{"locator":"Defining shift rotation rules / Rule satisfiability / Required weekly shift rotations","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Shift rotations","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/shift-rotations-and-patterns/shift-rotations"}],"state":"known","summary":"1.35.xはcontractsのshiftRotationRulesにWEEKLY/CUSTOMと複数rotationGroupsを定義し、勤務タグで勤務種別をまとめる。週次REQUIREDはある期間の1groupから次期間は別groupへ移るhard制約で、違反する割当は未割当になる。PREFERREDはsoft条件である。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"C01","label":"二交代・三交代・混在勤務","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"C02","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B25-20261012-OBS0002","label":"日跨ぎ夜勤と明け","limitations":"1.35.xの特定時間帯の勤務分数制限。夜勤という名称だけで法令の深夜時間を自動設定するとはしない。periodShiftOverlapKindとの組合せ、DSTの重複/欠落時刻、時差変更、丸め、明け後休日の自動生成は未検証。日本の行政・給与算式の適合を示すものではない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B25-20261012","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; sample outputs are vendor examples; live execution and deployment applicability untested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Count only minutes within a daily time interval","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Minutes worked per period","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/work-limits/minutes-worked-per-period"}],"state":"known","summary":"minutesWorkedLimit.countOnlyBetweenは日内の指定時間帯と勤務が重なる分だけを数える。開始時刻を含み終了時刻を含まず、終了が開始より前なら22:00〜06:00のように翌日へ跨ぐ。職員のタイムゾーンで解釈し、複数日に跨ぐ勤務は各日で重なりを計算する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"C02","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B25-20261012-OBS0001","label":"日跨ぎ夜勤と明け","limitations":"1.35.xの期間ルールの集計挙動。職員の明け勤務という別コード・勤務日数の二重計数・給与上の日付帰属を確定しない。分数と日数の集計を一律に同じ計数へ読み替えず、設定対象のルールを特定する必要がある。DST・月境界・最小単位・丸めの製品試験なし。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B25-20261012","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; sample outputs are vendor examples; live execution and deployment applicability untested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Counting days in rules / periodShiftOverlapKind START_ONLY and START_AND_END","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Days worked per period","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/work-limits/days-worked-per-period"}],"state":"known","summary":"期間・rolling windowのルールは、既定のSTART_ONLYでは勤務開始が対象期間内のシフトを数え、前日に始まって翌朝終わる夜勤を翌日の制限に含めないと説明する。periodShiftOverlapKindをSTART_AND_ENDへ変えると、対象期間に重なる夜勤の部分もルールの集計へ含める。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"C02","label":"日跨ぎ夜勤と明け","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"C05","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B25-20261012-OBS0004","label":"勤務間の休息時間","limitations":"previewは変更対象で安定版の普遍仕様・全顧客で利用可能とはしない。1.35.xは文字列だがlatest対照はtypeを含むオブジェクトとspan.tagsフィルタで、入力形式を混ぜない。対照URL=https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/latest/employee-resource-constraints/shift-rotations-and-patterns/minutes-between-shifts。現行実行モデル、移行・既存入力互換、除外時のscope計算と境界実動作は未確認。休暇を休息時間から除くことが日本法で必要と判断しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B25-20261012","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; sample outputs are vendor examples; live execution and deployment applicability untested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Absence-aware minutes between shifts (preview), 1.35.x string absenceMode","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Minutes between shifts","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/shift-rotations-and-patterns/minutes-between-shifts"}],"state":"known","summary":"1.35.xのabsenceModeはABSENCE_UNAWAREが既定で勤務間の経過時間を比較する。previewのABSENCE_AWAREはavailableTimeSpansまたはunavailableTimeSpansから不可用分を除き、最小休息の充足にも最大間隔の超過にもその分を数えないと説明する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"C05","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B25-20261012-OBS0003","label":"勤務間の休息時間","limitations":"1.35.xのAPI契約モデル内のルールで商用ライセンス契約ではない。例の720分・1440分は法定値や製品固定値ではない。08:00終了と720分の例は20:00以降を許すと説明するが、scopeちょうどの境界、秒精度・重複勤務・計画窓外の前後勤務・pinned例外は独立未検証。タグinclude/excludeの同じ側での併用不可とALL既定を保持。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B25-20261012","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; sample outputs are vendor examples; live execution and deployment applicability untested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Define minutes between shifts / scope / Rule satisfiability / Required and Preferred sections","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Minutes between shifts","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/shift-rotations-and-patterns/minutes-between-shifts"}],"state":"known","summary":"minutesBetweenShiftsRulesは前勤務の終了から後勤務の開始までの分数に最小・最大を設定し、REQUIREDではhard、PREFERREDではsoft制約にする。既定はREQUIRED。scope.durationは前終了＋期間を超えて始まる後勤務との組を除外し、前後の勤務タグでも対象を限定できる。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"C05","label":"勤務間の休息時間","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":0,"findings":[{"criterion":"D01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B01-O00342","label":"資格・職種別の必要人数","limitations":"公式記載の範囲のみ。設問の全要件・実動作・対象プランの詳細は未検証。","scope":{"product_scope":"プラン・地域・モジュールの限定は本文及びlimitations参照","record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B01-20261011","scope":"公式記載の範囲のみ"},"sources":[{"locator":"Model overview","retrieved_on":"2026-10-11","title":"Timefold ESS API導入仕様","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/latest/introduction"}],"state":"known","summary":"勤務枠のスキル要件等を扱う。日本の資格・配置規則は実装側のモデル化が必要。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"D01","label":"資格・職種別の必要人数","rationale":"公式記述の範囲で採用。設問の全要件と実性能への合格判定ではない。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":2,"findings":[{"criterion":"D03","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B29-20261013-OBS0002","label":"熟練度・スキルミックス","limitations":"技能IDに加えて指導者同伴をモデル化できる範囲。自動の熟練度査定、1指導者あたり研修生上限、数値スキル合計、臨床手技の独立可否の認定は未確認。同時刻でも別部署なら適切とは限らず、commonTagTypeなど部署条件も必要。例は独立試験ではない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B29-20261013","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; commercial plan applicability and live execution unconfirmed; vendor examples are not independent tests"},"sources":[{"locator":"Required pairings / includeEmployeeWithTags / asymmetric trainee-supervisor example","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Pairing employees","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/pairing-employees"}],"state":"known","summary":"requiredPairingsは指導対象職員へ指導者IDまたは職員タグを指定でき、タグ候補は少なくとも1タグで一致する。対象職員の勤務全体を覆う指導者の割当がなければhard違反となる。指導者は対象職員なしでも勤務できる。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"D03","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B29-20261013-OBS0001","label":"熟練度・スキルミックス","limitations":"1人への割当資格の組合せ。複数職員の技能を合算したチーム最低水準、数値の熟練度閾値ではない。requiredはhard、preferredはsoftで未充足割当があり得る。深さ/併用不可を除いた無制限の任意式とはしない。独立実行・顧客版/プラン未確認。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B29-20261013","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; commercial plan applicability and live execution unconfirmed; vendor examples are not independent tests"},"sources":[{"locator":"Skill matching strategies / Skills expressions / Preferred skill expressions","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Skills and risk factors","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/shift-service-constraints/skills-and-risk-factors"}],"state":"known","summary":"技能の複数条件は既定MATCH_ALLまたはMATCH_ANYを選べる。requiredSkillsExpressionはAND/ORを組み合わせた技能ID条件で、NODEの深さは2まで。同じ勤務でrequiredSkillsと必須式を併用できず、推奨技能式にも対応する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"D03","label":"熟練度・スキルミックス","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"E01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B25-20261012-OBS0006","label":"希望と確定休暇の区別","limitations":"1.35.xの希望入力。希望休と確定不可用・有給休暇の承認状態を同一にしない。priorityや重みの大小から希望の全実現・公平性・法令遵守を保証しない。役割・技能・他制約と競合する。希望の収集UI・権限・取消履歴・分母を用いた実現率の独立試験なし。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B25-20261012","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; sample outputs are vendor examples; live execution and deployment applicability untested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Defining employee preferences / preferred soft reward / Employees unpreferred times","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Employee preferences","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/employee-availability-and-preferences/employee-preferences"}],"state":"known","summary":"preferredTimeSpansとunpreferredTimeSpansはsoftの勤務希望で、働きたくない期間でも必要なら割当され得る。勤務と希望期間が重なる分数に、期間の重みと職員priority multiplierを掛けて報酬または罰点を付ける。期間の重みは省略時1、指定時は1以上の整数として説明する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"E01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B25-20261012-OBS0005","label":"希望と確定休暇の区別","limitations":"1.35.xの可用入力とhard制約。確定済み休暇を不可用へ変換する方法は実装側で設計する必要があり、申請・承認・取消・権限・休暇種類の完成済みワークフローがあるとはしない。明示不可用を単なるsoft希望へ変換しない。既定は不可用指定がなければ勤務可能。タグフィルタの適用漏れと境界の実試験なし。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B25-20261012","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; sample outputs are vendor examples; live execution and deployment applicability untested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Defining employee availability / unavailable times / available times / Friday unassigned example","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Employee availability","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/employee-availability-and-preferences/employee-availability"}],"state":"known","summary":"availableTimeSpansは列挙した期間だけ利用可能、unavailableTimeSpansは列挙した期間だけ利用不可とし、同一職員で両方は使えない。期間は日跨ぎで指定でき終了端はexclusive。不可用との重なりや利用可能期間で覆われない勤務分にはhard制約を適用し、例は必須シフトを未割当にして不可用を守る。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"E01","label":"希望と確定休暇の区別","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":0,"findings":[{"criterion":"E03","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B01-O00345","label":"契約勤務量を考慮した公平性","limitations":"公式記載の範囲のみ。設問の全要件・実動作・対象プランの詳細は未検証。","scope":{"product_scope":"プラン・地域・モジュールの限定は本文及びlimitations参照","record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B01-20261011","scope":"公式記載の範囲のみ"},"sources":[{"locator":"FTE adjustments","retrieved_on":"2026-10-11","title":"Timefold 公平性定義","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/latest/employee-resource-constraints/fairness/balance-time-worked"}],"state":"known","summary":"契約勤務割合FTEで勤務時間の公平性を補正する設定を文書化。ソフト条件。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"E03","label":"契約勤務量を考慮した公平性","rationale":"公式記述の範囲で採用。設問の全要件と実性能への合格判定ではない。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":0,"findings":[{"criterion":"E05","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B01-O00346","label":"複数月・長期の公平性","limitations":"公式記載の範囲のみ。設問の全要件・実動作・対象プランの詳細は未検証。","scope":{"product_scope":"プラン・地域・モジュールの限定は本文及びlimitations参照","record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B01-20261011","scope":"公式記載の範囲のみ"},"sources":[{"locator":"Historical time worked","retrieved_on":"2026-10-11","title":"Timefold 公平性定義","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/latest/employee-resource-constraints/fairness/balance-time-worked"}],"state":"known","summary":"過去の勤務時間を引き継いで公平性を評価する入力を文書化。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"E05","label":"複数月・長期の公平性","rationale":"公式記述の範囲で採用。設問の全要件と実性能への合格判定ではない。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"F01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B25-20261012-OBS0008","label":"必須条件と希望条件","limitations":"1.35.xの休暇周辺勤務ルール。休暇自体は職員のavailabilityで定義する説明。夜勤明けの休日を自動作成する完成済み日本向けパターンとはしない。0:00境界へ跨ぐ勤務、部分休・連続休、前後の暦日と職員timezoneの関係、タグ設定漏れ、例外承認は未検証。独立API試験なし。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B25-20261012","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; sample outputs are vendor examples; live execution and deployment applicability untested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Define tags / Rule satisfiability / Prohibited / Unpreferred sections","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Shifts to avoid close to day off requests","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/employee-resource-constraints/time-off/avoid-shifts-close-to-day-off-requests"}],"state":"known","summary":"休暇前後のavoidShiftCloseToDayOffRequestRulesは前日の避けるタグと翌日の避けるタグを別々に設定する。PROHIBITEDはhardで違反する割当を避け、UNPREFERREDはsoftで罰点を付けつつ割当され得る。省略時はPROHIBITED、タグのALL/ANYは省略時ALLで、片側のタグがなければその側に効果はない。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"F01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B25-20261012-OBS0007","label":"必須条件と希望条件","limitations":"1.35.xのスコア定義。mandatoryというラベルだけで全シフト充足をhardと判断しない。未割当を含むfeasibleと需要充足・最適性・解なし証明は別。0hardだけで日本の法令・未入力条件を満たすとは保証しない。既存B03の自己割当と変更抑制の一般相反は重複追加せず、今回の三段階定義を補足。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B25-20261012","scope":"Employee Shift Scheduling API documentation 1.35.x; sample outputs are vendor examples; live execution and deployment applicability untested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Overview / hard-medium-soft score / Constraint weights","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold Employee Shift Scheduling 1.35.x — Constraints","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/user-guide/constraints"}],"state":"known","summary":"制約をhard・medium・softに分け、hard違反はinfeasible、mediumは必須シフトをできるだけ割り当て、softは業務目標を改善すると説明する。hard違反0の解はsoftが低くてもhard違反のある解より良い。スコア値は違反の件数そのものではなく、重み×match scoreで評価する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"F01","label":"必須条件と希望条件","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":0,"findings":[{"criterion":"F02","delivery":"unknown","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B03-20261011-OBS0137","label":"最適化の優先順位方式","limitations":"公開資料に記載された機能・条件の確認。提供プラン・契約への適用や実動作、性能は未検証。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B03-20261011","scope":"プラン・地域・版の留保は本文・limitations参照"},"sources":[{"locator":"Disruption constraints","retrieved_on":"2026-10-11","title":"Self-rostering and optimization | Scenarios | Employee Shift Scheduling | Timefold Documentation","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.34.x/scenarios/self-rostering-and-optimization"}],"state":"known","summary":"任意シフトの充足と変更抑制はソフト条件で競合する。必須シフトは変更抑制より優先する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"F02","label":"最適化の優先順位方式","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":2,"findings":[],"id":"F04","label":"自然言語からの条件入力","rationale":"今回の確認範囲では設問全体を確定できない。非対応とは判断しない。","status":"unknown"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[],"id":"F05","label":"解釈内容の事前確認","rationale":"今回の確認範囲では設問全体を確定できない。非対応とは判断しない。 分類訂正：比較の再現手順の文書記載を、AIの条件解釈確認F05へ誤分類。実行結果ではない。","status":"unknown"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"G02","delivery":"unknown","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B03-20261011-OBS0138","label":"可解・解なし・未判定の区別","limitations":"公開資料に記載された機能・条件の確認。提供プラン・契約への適用や実動作、性能は未検証。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_ba