iggered, all constraints","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Dataset details","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/how-tos/interpreting-model-run-results"}],"state":"known","summary":"PlatformのScore analysisでは、制約が入力不足や未発火で無効になった場合にeffective weightを0と表示し、設定した重みと区別する。matchedフィルタはスコアに影響した制約、triggeredフィルタは有効だが罰点0の制約も表示する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"G04","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B30-20261013-OBS0002","label":"矛盾原因の根拠提示","limitations":"1.35.xの反実仮想比較手順で、元の結果から全代替案を自動列挙する証明ではない。仮の割当以外の入力/設定が同じかを管理する必要がある。局所最良/最良発見解と大域最適は別。最小矛盾集合・独立検算・未入力条件を含む法令適合は未確認。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B30-20261013","scope":"Official 1.35.x documentation; commercial plan applicability and live execution unconfirmed; vendor examples are not independent tests"},"sources":[{"locator":"Explaining why a specific assignment was not made / Provided schedule endpoint","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Score analysis","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/employee-shift-scheduling/1.35.x/user-guide/score-analysis"}],"state":"known","summary":"特定職員が特定勤務へ割り当てられなかった理由は、その割当を強制した仮の勤務表を作り、POST score-analysis?includeJustifications=trueで最良発見解と比較する方法を案内する。hard違反とsoft悪化を制約・対象オブジェクトへ結び付ける。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"G04","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B30-20261013-OBS0001","label":"矛盾原因の根拠提示","limitations":"1.35.xの出力仕様。違反箇所の根拠であり、最小の矛盾制約集合や全体の解なし証明ではない。全制約のjustification形状・一意ID/参照完全性・JSONと説明の整合・商用プラン/顧客実行版は独立未検証。B03の手作成表採点一般は再登録しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B30-20261013","scope":"Official 1.35.x documentation; commercial plan applicability and live executio' WHERE snapshot_id='B38-20261013-pub2' AND offering_id='OF-US10' AND slug='_aqsh_building_OF-US10' AND length(detail_json)=0;
