ioごとのdatasets配列だが文章は全M×Nであり、異なる集合の実行網羅性は未試験。集計指標を個別資格/曜日/時間の不足原因や最小採用数の証明へ拡張しない。preview・早期利用問い合わせ・プラン/費用/資源配分は未確認。API/実験/キー/権限変更なし。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B33-20261013","scope":"Platform latest; preview; documented partial scope, not independent product validation; commercial plan and current runtime unconfirmed"},"sources":[{"locator":"What-if scenarios / Core concepts / Creating an experiment / Reading the results","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Experiments","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/how-tos/experiments"}],"state":"known","summary":"previewのExperimentsは既存dataset IDを参照し、新しい入力は先にsolveせず登録する。入力変種とmodel version/profile/overrideを定義するscenarioを組み合わせ、M datasets×N scenariosのsolveを行い、scenarioごとの集計指標とbaseline差分を比較する。作成はAPI、結果参照はUIと説明する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"I06","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B33-20261013-OBS0004","label":"採用・応援の条件比較","limitations":"候補条件を利用者が用意する比較手順で、最適な採用資格/曜日/時間や最小採用必要数を自動算出/証明するとは確認できない。曜日/時間の可用条件・契約・費用・需要/期間を揃えた候補別実評価、改善量の統計確度、プラン/実行版とpreview利用権は未確認。B29技能やB30採点の一般事項は再登録しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B33-20261013","scope":"Platform latest; mutable; documented partial scope, not independent product validation; commercial plan and current runtime unconfirmed"},"sources":[{"locator":"Tips for getting the most insight today / Exploring what-if simulations","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Uncovering inefficiencies in operational planning","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/guides/uncovering-inefficiencies-in-operational-planning"}],"state":"known","summary":"公開ガイドは特定技能を持つ職員を追加/削除した入力を送って生産性の変化を比較し、勤務pattern・skill mix・team構成を変えるwhat-if simulationを案内する。Experimentsで変種を体系的に比較する導線も示す。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"I06","label":"採用・応援の条件比較","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status"