をEmployeeSchedule、/configをModelConfiguration2、/logsをLogInfo、/model-requestを完全入力requestのJSONとして返す仕様を示す。個別datasetの入力と実効設定とsolveログを別に取得する設計が確認できる。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"M08","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B32-20261013-OBS0004","label":"解約時の全量出力","limitations":"Platform latestの単一計画solution outputで、全テナントの入力希望/規則/実効設定/全revision/監査を同梱する全量出口ではない。1件の計画のfull detailsを契約終了時のfull exportへ拡張しない。実ファイル・プラン・解約後の取得期限/費用は未確認。B30の採点/justification一般を再登録せず既存文書を再利用する。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B32-20261013","scope":"Platform latest; mutable; official document/specification scope only; live customer version/plan and exit contract applicability unconfirmed"},"sources":[{"locator":"Planning solution output and visualization / Output JSON download","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Dataset details — solution output download","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/how-tos/interpreting-model-run-results"}],"state":"known","summary":"データセットのOutputでは計画の全詳細をJSONファイルとしてダウンロードできると説明する。Visualizationは出力品質のspot-check用として別に案内される。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"M08","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B32-20261013-OBS0003","label":"解約時の全量出力","limitations":"Platform latestの個別profile移送。別モデルや一致しないparameterは汎用import error、同一モデルのminor版間移送等が推奨される。勤務表/希望/データセット履歴/権限等が同梱される保証や全profile一括出口、再現互換性、解約期限/費用・プランは未確認。B31の作成/選択/優先順位を再登録せず、既存正規化文書を再利用する。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B32-20261013","scope":"Platform latest; mutable; official document/specification scope only; live customer version/plan and exit contract applicability unconfirmed"},"sources":[{"locator":"Export and import profiles","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Configuration profiles and parameters — export/import","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/how-tos/configuration-parameters-and-profiles"}],"state":"known","summary":"設定プロファイルは名称・説明・制約重み・モデル設定・solve設定を含む全体をJSONへExportし、read-onlyのStandardも対象とする。再Importは常に新規プロファイルを作り、既存へ上書き/mergeせず、元のdefault指定を自動継承しない。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"M08","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B32-20261013-OBS0002","label":"解約時の全量出力","limitations":"Platform latestの一覧CSVに関する上限で、希望・規則・設定・全履歴を内包した全量アーカイブを保証しない。画面のrevision表示とCSV列/全revision出力は別で、100件超の分割取得・整合性・削除済み範囲・CSV実試験・顧客プランは未確認。解約後の可用期限/費用も未確認。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B32-20261013","scope":"Platform latest; mutable; official document/specification scope only; live customer version/plan and exit contract applicability unconfirmed"},"sources":[{"locator":"Plans versus Revisions / Exporting search results","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Datasets overview","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/how-tos/categorizing-runs"}],"state":"known","summary":"Plans overviewは検索/フィルターに一致したデータセットをExport CSVで出力するが、対象は直近100件までと説明する。Plansは関連solveの連鎖ごとに最新revision、Revisionsは各revisionを表示する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"M08","label":"解約時の全量出力","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"N01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B31-20261013-OBS0004","label":"テナント分離・アクセス権限","limitations":"Platform latestの応答例で今回呼び出していない。例のENTERPRISEや全CRUDを顧客の契約/既定権限にしない。キーcallerのrole=nullを無権限・匿名職員の証明にせず、endpoint応答の権限情報と実データアクセス拒否を分ける。無効化・モデルscope・トークン共有時の実動作は未検証。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B31-20261013","scope":"Official Platform latest; caller identity and model-scoped API documentation; commercial plan applicability and live implementation unconfirmed; vendor access claims not independently tested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Discovering caller identity / response sample / 401 conditions","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Model API usage","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/api/model-api-usage"}],"state":"known","summary":"GET /api/aboutmeは現在のキー名、所属テナントとplan、resource/operationsの権限を返す診断方法を案内する。キーがない/未知/期限切れの場合は401と説明し、例のAPIキーcallerはroleやemailがnullでもMODEL/EXPERIMENTの操作権限を別に持つ。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"N01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B31-20261013-OBS0003","label":"テナント分離・アクセス権限","limitations":"Platform latestの文書条件で実拒否/期限境界/取消伝播/処理中リクエストは未試験。全管理者にキーがvisibleという記載を秘密値の再表示可否と同一にしない。権限名とHTTPメソッドは単純一致せず、DELETE /idはUpdate、/id/purgeはDelete、取得済みscore-analysisのGETは各操作列で可と表記する。プラン/実行版/外部顧客ACLは未確認。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B31-20261013","scope":"Official Platform latest; Model API permissions documentation; commercial plan applicability and live implementation unconfirmed; vendor access claims not independently tested"},"sources":[{"locator":"API Keys / scope / expiry / revocation / permission table","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — API Keys","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/how-tos/tenant-api-keys"}],"state":"known","summary":"Model APIキーはユーザー文脈を持たずテナントと選択モデルへ紐付き、全モデル/選択モデルと全操作/選択操作を選べる。期限未指定は30日、revoke後の後続API呼出は失敗すると説明する。ReadのみではPOST recommendationsやPOST score-analysisを呼べず、作成権限の対象として表記する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"N01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B31-20261013-OBS0002","label":"テナント分離・アクセス権限","limitations":"Platform latestの役割一覧。部署/本人単位のデータ行ACL・ロール変更や期限切れの反映時間・運用者の恒常アクセス範囲・実拒否は未確認。Experimentsはpreviewで、通常のtenant role一覧とは別にModel API keyの操作scopeで制御する但し書きがある。Userという名称だけで実験操作可と一律判断しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B31-20261013","scope":"Official Platform latest; Experiments role exception explicitly preview documentation; commercial plan applicability and live implementation unconfirmed; vendor access claims not independently tested"},"sources":[{"locator":"User roles / Invite member / Expiring members","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Members","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/how-tos/member-management-and-roles"}],"state":"known","summary":"Viewerはテナント内のモデル・全データセット・設定プロファイルを閲覧、Userは作成/再実行/取消や名称・タグ編集、Administratorは設定プロファイル・キー・メンバー・モデル等の管理を追加すると説明する。招待時に期限を指定し、Solutions Engineerの一時アクセスにも利用する案内がある。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"N01","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B31-20261013-OBS0001","label":"テナント分離・アクセス権限","limitations":"Platform latestの提供者記載で侵入/権限試験や第三者保証ではない。Cloudの複数テナントとself-hostedの単一テナントを同じ条件にしない。業務の施設/部署タグをテナント分離と見なさず、地域間データ同期・テナント数/追加費用・顧客プラン適用は未確認。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B31-20261013","scope":"Official Platform latest; Cloud vs self-hosted conditions documentation; commercial plan applicability and live implementation unconfirmed; vendor access claims not independently tested"},"sources":[{"locator":"Tenants provide isolation / Multiple geographic regions / Self-hosted single-tenant limitation","retrieved_on":"2026-10-13","title":"Timefold — Multiple environments and clusters","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/api/integration-scenarios/multi-environment"}],"state":"known","summary":"Platformはテナントを主な分離境界とし、モデル・データセット・メンバー・APIキー等をテナントごとに保持し、他テナントのデータをDB/アプリ両層で隔離すると説明する。所属する複数テナントの切替は可能。EU/USの名前空間は別で、self-hostedは1設置1テナントと明記する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"N01","label":"テナント分離・アクセス権限","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":0,"findings":[{"criterion":"N04","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B01-O00357","label":"保管地域・委託先","limitations":"公式記載の範囲のみ。設問の全要件・実動作・対象プランの詳細は未検証。","scope":{"product_scope":"プラン・地域・モジュールの限定は本文及びlimitations参照","record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B01-20261011","scope":"公式記載の範囲のみ"},"sources":[{"locator":"Hosting","retrieved_on":"2026-10-11","title":"Timefold リスク説明","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/trust/risk-profile"}],"state":"known","summary":"Timefold Cloudのapp.timefold.aiはGoogle Cloud europe-west1を使用と説明。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"N04","label":"保管地域・委託先","rationale":"公式記述の範囲で採用。設問の全要件と実性能への合格判定ではない。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[],"id":"N05","label":"生成AIへの送信・学習利用","rationale":"未確認理由を保持し、非対応・0円として扱わない。","status":"unknown"},{"context_count":0,"findings":[{"criterion":"N08","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B01-O00358","label":"必要最小限の入力","limitations":"公式記載の範囲のみ。設問の全要件・実動作・対象プランの詳細は未検証。","scope":{"product_scope":"プラン・地域・モジュールの限定は本文及びlimitations参照","record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B01-20261011","scope":"公式記載の範囲のみ"},"sources":[{"locator":"Sensitive data, PII and PHI","retrieved_on":"2026-10-11","title":"Timefold リスク説明","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/trust/risk-profile"}],"state":"known","summary":"クラウドへ送る入力は識別情報を匿名化・難読化する責任を顧客に求め、PHI用ではないと明記。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"N08","label":"必要最小限の入力","rationale":"公式記述の範囲で採用。設問の全要件と実性能への合格判定ではない。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":0,"findings":[{"criterion":"O03","delivery":"native","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B01-O00359","label":"復旧・データ復元","limitations":"公式記載の範囲のみ。設問の全要件・実動作・対象プランの詳細は未検証。","scope":{"product_scope":"プラン・地域・モジュールの限定は本文及びlimitations参照","record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B01-20261011","scope":"公式記載の範囲のみ"},"sources":[{"locator":"RTO / RPO","retrieved_on":"2026-10-11","title":"Timefold リスク説明","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/trust/risk-profile"}],"state":"known","summary":"重大障害の目標は復旧8時間、重要データの復旧時点6時間。保証された実績ではない。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"O03","label":"復旧・データ復元","rationale":"公式記述の範囲で採用。設問の全要件と実性能への合格判定ではない。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"O04","delivery":"unknown","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B21-20261012-OBS0003","label":"サポート窓口・時間","limitations":"専用支援窓口を確認したが、本文に受付時間帯・応答期限・保証・対応言語は確認できない。一般規約のinfo@timefold.aiを誤記と扱わず、一般とPlatformの導線を併存させる。連絡、アカウント・チケット作成は未実施。公開・更新日未表示。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B21-20261012","scope":"プラン・地域・版の留保は本文・limitations参照"},"sources":[{"locator":"Contacting support本文とmailto:support@timefold.ai","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold Platform：公開支援メール","url":"https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-platform/latest/support/contacting-support"}],"state":"known","summary":"Platform専用のContacting supportは支援メールsupport@timefold.aiを公開し、質問・問題への返信を案内する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"O04","delivery":"unknown","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B21-20261012-OBS0002","label":"サポート窓口・時間","limitations":"2026-04-21更新の一般条件。Orderや別SLAが優先し、契約製品・Platform/モデルの範囲はOrderで決まる。価格案内のHorizon 24/7は数値SLAを自動確定するものではなく、一方の記述を消さず条件差として保持。試用に営業支援を一切提供しないという断定はしない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B21-20261012","scope":"プラン・地域・版の留保は本文・limitations参照"},"sources":[{"locator":"Summary：technical support / 第5.1条Maintenance and support / Trials第2.8条（同番号が本文に重複） / mailto表示","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"Timefold General Terms：適用、支援、Resources、請求と契約更新","url":"https://timefold.ai/terms"}],"state":"known","summary":"一般規約は技術支援を商用独自ソフトウェアの契約顧客向けとし、info@timefold.aiを案内する。第5.1条は別途SLAを合意しない限りサービス水準の確約を付けず、試用中には保守・支援義務がないと記載する。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"O04","delivery":"unknown","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B21-20261012-OBS0001","label":"サポート窓口・時間","limitations":"Employee Shift Scheduling APIを含むPlatformの案内。24/7はHorizonの説明で全プランへ拡張しない。言語、応答・解決時間、緊急連絡の手順・対象障害、各契約のSLA・費用内包は未確認。Solver Communityの無料・支援なしを商用APIへ流用しない。公開・更新日未表示。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B21-20261012","scope":"プラン・地域・版の留