l":"サポート窓口・時間","limitations":"日本語窓口の記載は未確認。後続Workforce CentralのGold・Platinum条件をPro WFMへ転用しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B15-20261012","scope":"プラン・地域・版の留保は本文・limitations参照"},"sources":[{"locator":"SaaS Policies: Support Language","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"UKG Support Policies：Pro Workforce Managementを含むSaaS支援規程","url":"https://www.ukg.com/support-policies-and-services"}],"state":"known","summary":"基本の支援言語は英語。一部地域の営業時間に仏・独・西語も提供される場合がある。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"},{"criterion":"O04","delivery":"managed_service","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B15-20261012-OBS0010","label":"サポート窓口・時間","limitations":"初期応答の目標で、解決・復旧時間の保証ではない。Critical継続対応は顧客側の協力要員等にも依存。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B15-20261012","scope":"プラン・地域・版の留保は本文・limitations参照"},"sources":[{"locator":"SaaS Policies: Priority Based Support / Service Coverage Period","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"UKG Support Policies：Pro Workforce Managementを含むSaaS支援規程","url":"https://www.ukg.com/support-policies-and-services"}],"state":"known","summary":"SaaS支援はHighの初期応答目標30分、Mediumは営業1時間、Lowは営業2時間。Highだけ24時間365日、他は営業時間内と説明。","support":"limited","verification":"documented"}],"id":"O04","label":"サポート窓口・時間","rationale":"公開資料に記載された範囲を採用。部分確認を含む。実動作・性能・契約適用は未確認。","status":"documented"},{"context_count":1,"findings":[{"criterion":"P01","delivery":"unknown","evidence_role":"accepted","id":"B15-20261012-OBS0001","label":"料金方式・公開範囲","limitations":"製品を明示した見積方式。記事内の一般的なPEPM・拠点課金等を、この製品の確定した課金単位として採用しない。","scope":{"record_category":"document_observation","research_batch":"B15-20261012","scope":"プラン・地域・版の留保は本文・limitations参照"},"sources":[{"locator":"結論の製品別記載／FAQ: How much does workforce management software cost?","retrieved_on":"2026-10-12","title":"UKG WFM Pricing Guide 2026：Pro Workforce Managementの見積方式","url":"https://www.ukg.com/learn/article-library/operations-leaders/how-much-does-workforce-management-software-cost-b